  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance to the Affected Most Vulnerable People - Chattogram Division Flash Floods and Monsoon Rain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to provide food security assistance to vulnerable people affected by floods in the Chattogram Division. This WFP project provides food and cash assistance to people affected by the severe flooding to help them meet their basic food, nutrition, and other essential needs. This project targets 101,291 people, of whom 31,393 are women, 30,767 are men, 39,131 are children, and 1,673 are people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
